  "description": "The triage fleet (Fleet 2, signal-fleet): what needs the operator now (queued work, escalations, the oldest item), its decisions and dispositions over time and by source, spend and tokens, noise removed and re-triages avoided, fleetd cycles, their duration and day spend against the cap, and the GlitchTip sync.",
